{#
  The review step "Send for approval" opens before the status actually
  changes — reached by capturing the editor's current live content first
  (the same fetch/payload "Preview" already uses, see page.njk's
  pageScripts), then navigating here rather than acting immediately. Ported
  from the now-retired /v6/editor-2-3-view, whose own version of this page
  already solved the "nothing continues after Send for approval" gap the
  consolidation plan's crawl found on every other editor — see
  controller.js's own getSendForApproval/postSendForApproval.

  The status badge shown here is deliberately the TARGET state (Awaiting
  approval, yellow — matching the document overview page's own statusTags),
  not the document's current one: this page is a preview of what is about
  to happen, not a record of what already has.

  Clicking "Send for approval" below POSTs to this same URL
  (postSendForApproval) — the real state change: the id moves from Editing
  to Awaiting approval for the rest of the session
  (app/data/manage-guidance.js), then redirects to that document's own
  overview page, where the updated badge and the loss of any edit option
  are visible proof the move actually happened.
#}
{% extends "common/layouts/content.njk" %}

{% from "govuk/components/summary-list/macro.njk" import govukSummaryList %}
{% from "govuk/components/tag/macro.njk" import govukTag %}
{% from "govuk/components/button/macro.njk" import govukButton %}

{% set pageName = "Send for approval" %}

{% set sectionsCell %}
  {% if sections and sections.length %}
    <ol class="govuk-list govuk-list--number">
      {% for section in sections %}
        <li>{{ section.sectionName }}</li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ol>
  {% else %}
    No content sections
  {% endif %}
{% endset %}

{% set statusCell %}{{ govukTag({ text: "Awaiting approval", classes: "govuk-tag--yellow" }) }}{% endset %}

{% block columns %}

  <h1 class="govuk-heading-l">Send for approval</h1>

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Check the details below before sending this guidance for approval.
  </p>

  {{ govukSummaryList({
    rows: [
      { key: { text: "Guidance title" }, value: { text: documentName } },
      { key: { text: "Description" }, value: { text: description } },
      { key: { text: "Content sections" }, value: { html: sectionsCell } },
      { key: { text: "Status" }, value: { html: statusCell } }
    ]
  }) }}

  <p class="govuk-body">
    Sending this guidance for approval will change its status to Awaiting
    approval. It will no longer be editable until an owner reviews it.
  </p>

  <form method="post" action="/consolidated/editor/send-for-approval">
    {{ govukButton({ text: "Send for approval" }) }}
  </form>

{% endblock %}
